      "content": "hey so i woke up this morning and my face feels kinda weird. like the left side of my mouth is drooping a bit and i cant really close my eye all the way on that side. is this just like bell's palsy or something? i'm kinda worried it might be a stroke but i dont have a headache or anything so maybe its nothing?",
