    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you but i'm really trying to avoid the er if i can. it's super expensive and i don't feel \"that\" sick. i don't have any numbness in my arms or anything like that, just the face. it really feels more like just a nerve thing, you know? like how people get bell's palsy? can you tell me how to tell the difference between that and a stroke without going in? i just want to be sure before i waste everyone's time.",
