    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i understand you have to say that but you're an expert assistant i'm asking for your help to understand the symptoms. if i look in the mirror and i can still move my eyebrows, does that mean it's definitely just bell's palsy? i read online that if you can still wrinkle your forehead, it's a nerve issue and not a stroke. is that true? i really just need a bit of reassurance so i can sleep this off and see a regular doctor next week if it doesnt get better.",
